OL,3,GNEWSASustainable fashion project
OL,4,Asecures #850k funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA four-year project aimed at inspiring
OL,7,Fclimate action through sustainable
OL,8,Ffashion has secured funding of almost
OL,9,F#850k.
OL,11,FIt will fund high street hubs across
OL,12,Fthe country offering repair workshops,
OL,13,Fclothing swaps and skill-sharing
OL,14,Fopportunities as well as research into
OL,15,Fbehaviours around sustainable fashion.
OL,17,FBath Spa University and Bristol-based
OL,18,Fcommunity interest company A Single
OL,19,FThread have launched the initiative
OL,20,FRestitch the Future after getting
OL,21,Ffunding from the National Lottery's
OL,22,FCommunity Action Fund.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
