OL,3,GNEWSASustainable fashion project
OL,4,Asecures #850k funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmelia Twine, founder of A Single
OL,7,FThread CIC, said, "too often
OL,8,Fsustainable fashion is perceived as
OL,9,Fexpensive, exclusive or unrealistic"
OL,10,Fbut the initiative is about "changing
OL,11,Fthat narrative".
